Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"

Dear Menatullah,

Thank you for meeting with us this morning.

You will find a formal letter of notice attached here. We also wanted to assure you that we are prepared to facilitate a smooth transition, which includes:

  *   Assistance in transferring your grants
  *   Assistance in supporting your research scientist in completing as much work as possible in the month remaining
  *   Supporting you in finalizing any existing UBC collaborations

Even when your Affiliate position has ended, you are, of course, free to continue collaboration with UBC faculty and students. If a student wants to continue to have you serve on their committee, they will need to get approval from the UBC Faculty of Graduate and Postdoctoral Studies.

Regards,

- Margo

Margo Seltzer
Co-Head Department of Computer Science
The University of British Columbia

